[IMP] resource: variable resource calendar

This commit introduces the variable resource calendar. It's a type of working
schedule where the user can specify exactly the date of an attendance. So
instead of a Monday weekly attendance it can now be a 9 Feb 2026 attendance or
an attendance every 4 days (supports many types of recurrencies).

This replaces the old two weeks calendar offering more flexibility when
designing working schedules.

